From 37e718beccec25e53e91d45ce87fab77a00969f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 22:57:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] art: scope Floral mixed ELF routing to hybrid mode

Keep NativeLoader's mixed host and guest namespaces exclusive to hybrid mode. For direct mode, select the backend through the aggregate router before pre-initialization, then bind ART's active handle and callback table to the selected backend DSO.

This preserves zygote backend preloading while making direct initialization, namespaces, library loading, trampolines, and error reporting follow the standalone backend path.

Change-Id: I8663d02e58c74abfec3a8e22fe730a7467360be0
